# original seven-to-four decomposition and its four proposed controls
# (attention-global/lane/escalation/Herdr-polling) are withdrawn along with
# the attention scheduler they would have governed -- replaced by the
# single task-queue-nudge automation control described above. Solar
# published the full replacement design (sections A-H, ten required
# adversarial tests, section F = this finding's control shape) at
# 01M26Q8J7HRAGP5VAA66H4AWFV. Per Rand's full-stop order relayed by fenix
